{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": { "id": "header" },
      "source": [
        "# 🎙️ TurboVoiceCloner: Final Stable Build 2026\n",
        "**Env:** Python 3.11 (Isolated) | **Engine:** Chatterbox-v2 | **Turbo Speed:** Active\n",
        "\n",
        "### 🚀 निर्देश:\n",
        "1. **T4 GPU** को चालू रखें।\n",
        "2. सेल्स को 1, 2, 3 क्रम में चलाएं।"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": { "id": "setup" },
      "source": [
        "%%bash\n",
        "# @title 📦 1. Setup Micromamba Environment\n",
        "set -e\n",
        "cd /content\n",
        "if [ ! -f \"bin/micromamba\" ]; then\n",
        "  curl -Ls https://micro.mamba.pm/api/micromamba/linux-64/latest | tar -xvj bin/micromamba\n",
        "  ./bin/micromamba create -y -n cb311 -c conda-forge python=3.11 pip\n",
        "fi\n",
        "echo \"✅ Micromamba ready at /content/bin/micromamba\"\n",
        "echo \"✅ Env created: cb311\""
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": { "id": "install" },
      "source": [
        "%%bash\n",
        "# @title 🚀 2. High-Speed Installation\n",
        "set -euo pipefail\n",
        "MICROMAMBA=\"/content/bin/micromamba\"\n",
        "echo \"Installing PyTorch 2.5.1 (CUDA 12.1)...\"\n",
        "$MICROMAMBA run -n cb311 pip install -U pip setuptools wheel -q\n",
        "$MICROMAMBA run -n cb311 pip install torch==2.5.1+cu121 torchaudio==2.5.1+cu121 --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu121 -q\n",
        "echo \"Installing Chatterbox-v2 (Fixing Hindi Logic)...\"\n",
        "$MICROMAMBA run -n cb311 pip install --no-cache-dir --upgrade git+https://github.com/devnen/chatterbox-v2.git@master gradio==4.44.1 -q\n",
        "echo \"✅ Turbo High Speed Components Installed!\""
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": { "id": "server" },
      "source": [
        "# @title ⚙️ 3. Launch Simple Web UI & Server\n",
        "import os, subprocess, socket\n",
        "from google.colab.output import serve_kernel_port_as_window\n",
        "\n",
        "PORT = 8004\n",
        "REPO_DIR = \"/content/Chatterbox-TTS-Server\"\n",
        "if not os.path.exists(REPO_DIR):\n",
        "    subprocess.run([\"git\", \"clone\", \"https://github.com/devnen/Chatterbox-TTS-Server.git\"], check=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "os.chdir(REPO_DIR)\n",
        "print(\"Starting Server... Simple UI with Language Fix is loading.\")\n",
        "env = os.environ.copy()\n",
        "env[\"PYTHONUNBUFFERED\"] = \"1\"\n",
        "\n",
        "cmd = [\"/content/bin/micromamba\", \"run\", \"-n\", \"cb311\", \"python\", \"-u\", \"server.py\"]\n",
        "proc = subprocess.Popen(cmd, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.STDOUT, text=True, env=env)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n🔥 UI LOADING... CLICK BELOW\")\n",
        "serve_kernel_port_as_window(PORT)\n",
        "\n",
        "while True:\n",
        "    line = proc.stdout.readline()\n",
        "    if line:\n",
        "        print(line, end=\"\")\n",
        "    if proc.poll() is not None: break"
      ],
      "outputs": []
    }
  ],
